Comment: 1,0:01:37.79,0:01:40.79,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\a6}EXCITED
Dialogue: 99,0:00:01.48,0:00:02.98,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Wow, would you look at that.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:03.35,0:00:05.51,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,There are so many different rooms.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:05.51,0:00:07.76,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Don't get too excited.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:07.76,0:00:08.36,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:09.00,0:00:12.04,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,love hotels aren't exactly professional.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:15.77,0:00:17.50,Alt,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,{\an8}This room is gorgeous.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:13.88,0:00:17.50,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wasn't comfortable leaving her \Nat home while I'm away on business.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:17.87,0:00:20.82,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}A cheap business hotel would've been fine,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:20.82,0:00:24.17,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}but this is a little embarrassing.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:24.17,0:00:25.38,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh well!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:30.95,0:00:32.84,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,This is the best.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:32.84,0:00:36.02,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,I'm so happy to see you this pleased, Akane.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:36.76,0:00:40.83,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}It definitely has nothing to do with being in a place
Dialogue: 99,0:00:40.83,0:00:43.40,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}where she can easily pressure me into sex.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:43.85,0:00:44.65,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Hey, Akane?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:45.36,0:00:46.40,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}Here it comes.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:46.91,0:00:50.03,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Listen, I have a really long meeting this evening,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:50.03,0:00:53.31,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,so I need to go and prep for that, okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:54.83,0:00:56.12,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:56.12,0:00:59.87,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,I'll stay on standby so \NI don't interfere with your work.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:01.21,0:01:03.79,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wow, she can actually read the room.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:05.15,0:01:07.88,Default,Coworker,0,0,0,,All right, see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:07.88,0:01:10.45,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Looking forward to it. See you then.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:12.98,0:01:15.56,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait, she seriously hasn't tried anything yet?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:16.12,0:01:19.15,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was sure she'd pull something naughty on me,
Dialogue: 99,0:01:19.15,0:01:20.89,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}but no, nothing.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:22.01,0:01:22.65,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Akane?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:22.65,0:01:23.52,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Yeah?!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:23.78,0:01:25.55,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Is your meeting over?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:25.55,0:01:26.58,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:26.58,0:01:27.65,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}Here it is.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:27.93,0:01:29.54,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's happening.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:29.54,0:01:31.78,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Well then, shall we go to bed?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:31.86,0:01:33.49,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:35.33,0:01:37.79,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}How the heck am I supposed to sleep?!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:38.03,0:01:40.27,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}She really isn't going to make a move?!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:40.27,0:01:42.70,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have an early start tomorrow, \Nso I should sleep, but...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:42.70,0:01:44.67,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}Calm down.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:45.20,0:01:46.29,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just calm down.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:48.51,0:01:50.30,Alt,TV,0,0,0,,{\an8}I can't take it anymore.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:49.38,0:01:50.30,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Huh? The TV?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:50.60,0:01:52.21,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,That's so weird.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:53.20,0:01:55.05,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Why won't this stupid thing turn off?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:55.88,0:01:58.81,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,That woman reminds me of you, Akane.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:59.96,0:02:00.81,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Huh? How so?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:02.82,0:02:04.56,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,In the way she responds during sex.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:06.17,0:02:08.51,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Hey, Akane?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:10.25,0:02:13.11,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Would you like to recreate what they're doing?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:14.57,0:02:16.45,Default,TV,0,0,0,,Yes, I need it now.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:16.77,0:02:18.03,Default,TV,0,0,0,,You need what?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:18.43,0:02:20.58,Default,TV,0,0,0,,Go on, say it.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:20.58,0:02:22.71,Default,TV,0,0,0,,You know. Don't make me say it.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:22.71,0:02:24.75,Alt,TV,0,0,0,,{\an8}I wanna hear you beg, cutie.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:23.07,0:02:24.04,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Akane?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:24.71,0:02:25.79,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,What would you like me to do?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:26.47,0:02:27.19,Default,TV,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:28.35,0:02:29.92,Default,TV,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:33.96,0:02:36.64,Default,TV,0,0,0,,I need you to make me cum.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:37.16,0:02:39.00,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't say that, but...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:42.81,0:02:45.66,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Understood. Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:57.06,0:02:58.16,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Nadeshiko...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:13.46,0:03:15.60,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Nadeshiko...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:31.71,0:03:33.90,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Thank you for the advice,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:34.15,0:03:35.59,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Mother.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:35.59,0:03:39.66,Default,Sakurako,0,0,0,,I'm just glad I could help, Nadeshiko.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:39.97,0:03:43.04,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,You were a huge help. By the way,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:43.81,0:03:46.46,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,why did you only contact me?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:46.46,0:03:50.33,Default,Sakurako,0,0,0,,Well, it's a bit too soon for me to meet your master.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:50.60,0:03:55.21,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,I can't wait to introduce Akane to you, Mother.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:55.21,0:03:56.84,Default,Sakurako,0,0,0,,Hmm. Is that so?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:57.74,0:03:58.34,Default,Sakurako,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:58.73,0:04:03.57,Default,Sakurako,0,0,0,,Once she's officially registered \Nas your master, you can both come visit.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:04.39,0:04:05.64,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:05.64,0:04:08.99,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Then I'll work even harder \Nto complete her registration.
